hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1193","Salama bin Shabib told us, Abu Dawud al-Tayalisi told us, Muhammad bin Muslim al-Qurashi told us, my grandfather Abu al-Muthanna told me, on the authority of Ibn Umar, and Ahmad bin Abdullah bin Ali bin Suwayd bin Manjuf told us, Abu Dawud, on the authority of Muhammad bin Muslim bin Mahran, My grandfather told me, on the authority of Ibn Umar, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “May God have mercy on a man who prayed four times before the afternoon prayer.”"
